[signal arg="CONVOSTART"]
CharlieBones: Good nevermourn, Virtue
label CharlieDialogue
- Who are you?
	Virtue: Who are you?
	CharlieBones: Just some bones.
	jump CharlieDialogue
- Are you my client?
	CharlieBones: 'fraid not.
	CharlieBones: They should be waiting for you somewhere by hallway though.
	jump CharlieDialogue
- (Leave Conversation)
	CharlieBones: If you could do me a favor? tell Claudma about the lovley mist outside...
	CharlieBones: very lovley...
	set {ChToCla} = true
	set {Charlie1Interact} = false
	[signal arg="CONVOISOVER"]
	[end_timeline]